Abstract
Medium to grow cyanobacteria, in particular Prochlorococcus and Synechococcus

Reference

Rippka, R., Coursin, T., Hess, W., Lichtle, C., Scanlan, D.J., Palinska, K.A., Iteman, I. et al. 2000. Prochlorococcus
marinus Chisholm et al. 1992 subsp. pastoris subsp. nov. strain PCC 9511, the first axenic chlorophyll a2/b2-
containing cyanobacterium (Oxyphotobacteria). Int. J. Syst. Evol. Microbiol. 50:1833–47.

