     Prepare solutions
      1     Hepes-NaOH 1M
              To 250 mL of H20, add gradually 119.15g of Hepes.
              Adjust pH at 7.5 and complete the volume at 500 mL.
              Store in refrigerator.
     2      Na2-EDTA/FeCl3
              To 40 mL of HCl 0.1 N, add gradually 1,080 g of FeCl3
              To 40 mL of NaOH 0.1 N, add gradually 1,488 g of Na2-EDTA
              Mix both solutions
              Complete final volume to 2 L of sterile water
              Store in refrigerator
     3      Sodium Phosphate
              Prepare two solutions :
              Monosodium dihydrogen phosphate (NaH2PO4) at 50 mM (6 g in 1 L)
              Disodium hydrogen phosphate (Na2HPo4) at 50 mM (3.55 g in 500 mL)
              Make an equimolar mixture of these two solutions and adjust the pH at 7,5
     4
                   To 500 mL of H20, add gradually elements indicated in the table below.
                   Complement the volume to 1L. Store in refrigerator.

